    <h1>Friends of Inner Flowing</h1>
    <p>Qigong is the heart of what I teach, and it is all Inner Flowing offers. But it sits alongside other traditions that work with the same body and the same energy from a different direction, and students often ask where to find them.</p>
    <p>Jenny and Amy are teachers I have worked with directly and recommend without hesitation. Their offerings are listed below, and enquiries go to them.</p>

